+  claimed original/submitted result = -99
+  false mutated result = -98
+
+The dry run exits 0, establishing that the mutation parses and builds. The
+actual proof exits 1 with WarnStuckClaimState and the residual disequality
+qualifyingSumAcc(...) +Int 1 =/= qualifyingSumAcc(...).

